{#
  BeMart admin Template list — EC-CUBE goTemplateList (テンプレート一覧).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Store/template.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Store/template.twig).

  Store section, DATA/LIST page. It extends the admin frame
  (`admin-base.html.twig`, the port of EC-CUBE's admin `default_frame.twig`),
  not the storefront `base.html.twig`. The markup skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*`
  / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE; only the dynamic
  bindings are rebound to the TemplateList resource body
  (src/Resource/Page/Admin/Template/TemplateList.php — body carries
  `count` + `templates`, a list of {templateId, templateName,
  deviceType}).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `url(route, params)` -> deterministic `/{route}?{query}`
     (`BeMartTwigExtension`).
   - `{% for Template in Templates %}` -> the resource body's
     `templates` list. EC-CUBE keys the per-row action `<a>`s by the
     numeric `Template.id` and reads `Template.code` for the save path /
     active-template check; the AdminTemplateListFetched projection
     surfaces `templateId` (used as the row key) and `templateName`, but
     NOT a separate template `code`. The save-path `<li>`s
     (`app/template/{code}`, `html/template/{code}`) therefore render
     with `templateId` in place of `code`. FLAGGED missing-body-field.
   - `Template.default_template` (the "デフォルトテンプレートは削除でき
     ません" delete-disable guard) -> NOT carried by the projection; the
     delete `<a>` is never `disabled`. FLAGGED missing-body-field.
   - `eccube_config.eccube_theme_code` (the currently-active template,
     used for the `checked` radio + the delete-disable guard) -> BeMart's
     html context exposes no `eccube_config`; the radio is never
     pre-checked. Enumerated as residual.
   - `template.twig` is technically a Symfony form page — it wraps the
     table in a `<form>` with `form_widget(form._token)` (CSRF) and
     `form_widget(form.selected)` (a hidden field carrying the chosen
     radio value). The TemplateList resource is a list-only endpoint
     (ALPS exposes no template select/delete affordance — see the
     resource doc), so it carries no `body['form']`. The page is ported
     as a DATA page: the surrounding `<form>` markup is kept verbatim,
     the radio `<input>`s (which EC-CUBE itself emits as literal markup,
     not `form_widget`) port unchanged, and only the two `form_widget`
     calls become enumerated residuals — exactly as the News-list pilot
     treats `csrf_token_for_anchor()`.
   - `csrf_token_for_anchor()` on the delete `<a>` -> EC-CUBE
     per-request CSRF widget. OMITTED exactly as the storefront ports
     omit it. EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin_store_template' %}
{% set title = 'テンプレート一覧' %}
{% set sub_title = 'オーナーズストア' %}

{% block javascript %}
    <script>
        $(function () {
            $('#form1').on('submit', function () {
                $('#form_selected').val($('input[name=template]:checked').val());
            });
        });
    </script>
{% endblock javascript %}

{% block main %}
    <form name="form1" id="form1" method="post" action="{{ url('admin_store_template') }}">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
            <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
                <div class="c-primaryCol">
                    <div class="d-block mb-3">
                        <a class="btn btn-ec-regular" href="{{ url('admin_store_template_install') }}">新規作成</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header"><span class="card-title">テンプレート一覧</span></div>
                        <div class="card-body p-0">
                            <table class="table">
                                <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 align-middle text-center">選択</th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 align-middle text-center">テンプレート名</th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0 align-middle text-center">保存先</th>
                                    <th class="border-top-0"></th>
                                </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                {% for Template in templates %}
                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="align-middle text-center">
                                            <input type="radio" name="template" value="{{ Template.templateId }}"/>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle text-center">{{ Template.templateName }}</td>
                                        <td class="align-middle text-center">
                                            <ul>
                                                <li>app/template/{{ Template.templateId }}</li>
                                                <li>html/template/{{ Template.templateId }}</li>
                                            </ul>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="align-middle text-center icon_edit">
                                            <div class="row justify-content-end">
                                                <div class="col-auto text-center">
                                                    <a href="{{ url('admin_store_template_download', { 'id' : Template.templateId }) }}"
                                                       class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon action-download" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top"
                                                       title="ダウンロード">
                                                        <i class="fa fa-cloud-download fa-lg text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                                <div class="col-auto text-center">
                                                    <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="削除">
                                                        <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon action-delete"
                                                           data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#confirmModal-{{ loop.index }}">
                                                            <i class="fa fa-close fa-lg text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="modal fade" id="confirmModal-{{ loop.index }}" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="confirmModal-{{ loop.index }}" aria-hidden="true">
                                                        <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
                                                            <div class="modal-content">
                                                                <div class="modal-header">
                                                                    <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">削除します</h5>
                                                                    <button class="btn-close" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="modal-body text-start">
                                                                    <p class="text-start">この操作はあとから取り消すことができません。「{{ Template.templateName }}」を削除してよろしいですか？</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="modal-footer">
                                                                    <button class="btn btn-ec-sub" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">キャンセル</button>
                                                                    <a class="btn btn-ec-delete" data-confirm="false"
                                                                       href="{{ url('admin_store_template_delete', { 'id': Template.templateId}) }}">
                                                                        削除
                                                                    </a>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                {% endfor %}
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="c-conversionArea">
            <div class="c-conversionArea__container">
                <div class="row justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div class="c-conversionArea__leftBlockItem">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6">
                        <div id="ex-conversion-action" class="row align-items-center justify-content-end">
                            <div class="col-auto">
                                <button class="btn btn-ec-conversion px-5" type="submit">登録</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </form>
{% endblock %}
